  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "In the bustling kitchen of Claude Monet, French pastry chef Louis is overwhelmed by an enormous banquet order. Desperate for assistance, he appeals to Chef Viktor Barinov, who decides that novice cook Max will be his helper for the day. Let's listen to their conversation in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Шеф, у меня большие проблемы.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Что опять случилось на кухне?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Мне срочно нужен хороший помощник.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Почему ты не работаешь один?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я один сегодня не справлюсь.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "У тебя слишком много работы?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Пришёл очень большой заказ на банкет.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Что именно нужно приготовить?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Свежие круассаны и большой торт.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Макс будет работать с тобой.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Но он ничего не умеет.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Он будет чистить и резать.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ладно, пусть моет посуду.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Now let's examine Louis and Chef Barinov's kitchen exchange line by line.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Шеф, у меня большие проблемы.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Chef, I have big problems.' -- Louis calls out to Chef Barinov, stating that he faces severe trouble in the pastry kitchen.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Что опять случилось на кухне?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What happened in the kitchen again?' -- Barinov asks gruffly, wanting to know what new crisis has occurred.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Мне срочно нужен хороший помощник.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I urgently need a good assistant.' -- Louis explains that he requires a capable helper right away.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Почему ты не работаешь один?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Why are you not working alone?' -- Barinov questions why the French pastry chef cannot manage by himself.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я один сегодня не справлюсь.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I alone will not manage today.' -- Louis admits that handling the workload alone is completely impossible.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "У тебя слишком много работы?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Do you have too much work?' -- The chef inquires whether the volume of preparation is truly excessive.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Пришёл очень большой заказ на банкет.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'A very big banquet order arrived.' -- Louis reveals that a massive banquet booking has been received.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Что именно нужно приготовить?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What exactly needs to be prepared?' -- Barinov asks for specific details about the required menu items.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Свежие круассаны и большой торт.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Fresh croissants and a big cake.' -- Louis lists the pastries, including fresh croissants and a large cake.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Макс будет работать с тобой.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Max will work with you.' -- The chef decides to send junior cook Max to assist him for the shift.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Но он ничего не умеет.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'But he does not know how to do anything.' -- Louis complains that the novice cook lacks proper culinary skill.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Он будет чистить и резать.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'He will peel and cut.' -- Barinov points out that basic tasks like peeling and chopping will save time.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Ладно, пусть моет посуду.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
